(I) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Here was a man who was born with two great gifts, one the most precious) Tj T*
(in the world, the other the most perilous. The first was an abounding) Tj T*
(physical vitality which made the casual business of being alive a) Tj T*
(divine adventure, the second, an imagination of the sort which refuses) Tj T*
(discipline and runs away with the whole mind.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The adventure begins in the spring of the year 1772 with the farmers) Tj T*
