(He was a marine, now, on a British naval vessel; a roving Yankee caught) Tj T*
(up in the old navy?s conventionalised routine. A bugle or a drum tattoo) Tj T*
(woke him at early dawn as he slept in the low ?tween deck caves where the) Tj T*
(timbers groaned when the wind freshened in the night, and the lanterns) Tj T*
(and the hammocks swung to the listing of the ship; he escaped from the) Tj T*
(darkness below, the warm, human smell, and the sight of sleepy men and) Tj T*
(nakedness to the humid deck, the lilac morning, and the vast splendour of) Tj T*
(the awakening sea; the drill drum beat for him, he heard the shuffle and) Tj T*
(the tramp of feet, the peremptory order, and, in the silences, the wind) Tj T*
(in the rigging and the endless, dissolving whisper of alongside foam.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This _Discovery_ was the more interesting of the ships. Captain Cook) Tj T*
(himself was aboard, a man over six feet in height, with brown eyes, a) Tj T*
(pleasant countenance, and brown hair tied behind. Ledyard often saw the) Tj T*
(tall figure in great cloak and three-cornered hat standing at the other) Tj T*
(end of the deck. Perhaps of even greater interest to the ship?s company) Tj T*
(was the Noah?s ark farmyard aboard of cattle, sheep, goats, ducks, dogs,) Tj T*
(horses, cats, pigs, and rabbits, all intended as gifts to estimable) Tj T*
(savages who had no such allies, for the eighteenth century was nothing if) Tj T*
(not benevolent. When in port for any length of time, the sea-going bull) Tj T*
(and the other grazing animals were put ashore for pasturage; at the Cape) Tj T*
(of Good Hope, a rascally Hottentot delayed the expedition by stealing) Tj T*
(a salty and intrepid cow. During a stay in the east, this animal world) Tj T*
(was strengthened by a vast contingent of cockroaches who fell in showers) Tj T*
(to the deck when the sails were unfurled before getting under way; not) Tj T*
(a romantic picture, this, but one with a genuine flavor of old sailing) Tj T*
(ship days. And when all other things wearied, there was a battle to) Tj T*
(watch, that battle with never a truce which is the sailing of a sailing) Tj T*
(ship in open sea.) Tj T*
