(for I am at this moment the slave of cowardly solicitude lest in the) Tj T*
(heart of this dread winter, there lurk the seeds of disappointment to my) Tj T*
(ardent desire of gaining the opposite continent.? Not knowing what to do) Tj T*
(he joined a scientific expedition in charge of one ?Captain? Billings,) Tj T*
(a fellow veteran of Cook?s third voyage, and returned with his former) Tj T*
(shipmate to Irkutsk.) Tj T*
