(are affixed ledges to support the men who cling about him.... When thus) Tj T*
(encumbered, he moves as easy and as graceful as if about to walk a) Tj T*
(minuet, and displays a flag in as flippant a manner as a dancer on the) Tj T*
(rope.? Another visitor became poetic. ?Signor Belzoni,? he wrote, ?moved) Tj T*
